ontent":"Twenty years on the floor, and you finally signed up — that's not nothing. And then your dad died in March, the same dad who had you stirring something in the kitchen and telling jokes so nobody was sad out loud.\n\nThe page still open on your phone. What's it like to look at it?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Twenty years on the floor, and you finally signed up — that's not nothing. And then your dad died in March, the same dad who had you stirring something in the kitchen and telling jokes so nobody was sad out loud.\n\nThe page still open on your phone. What's it like to look at it?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":6484,"promptTokens":1713,"completionTokens":162,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:07:09"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":57,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"41a03209f68e479c82af3d76a21f263e","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":9.6101348069524E-5,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b03f42d6438f403db4d1743","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795421229124,"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:07:09","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f42d6438f403db4d1743","chatId":"1bbd72ff1b394541bee1cad1fb057138","sessionId":null,"userId":130567,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"I finally signed up for the LPN prereq in the spring. twenty years on the floor and I was going to actually do it. then my dad died in March and I withdrew in the summer, and the fall deadline went by while I had the page open on my phone","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContex